# Frontend environment (Vercel: Project → Settings → Environment Variables)
#
# Local development defaults to /api/v1 which is proxied by Vite to the local
# Cloudflare worker (see vite.config.ts). For production, point at your deployed
# Cloudflare Workers API, e.g.:
#   https://affiliate-hub-api.<your-subdomain>.workers.dev/api/v1
# or a custom domain like   https://api.yourdomain.com/api/v1
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api/v1

# Optional: Google Analytics measurement ID (ad interactions are already tracked)
# VITE_GA_ID=G-XXXXXXXXXX
